Package: saio
Title: Access the Stock Assessment Inputs and Outputs Database
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Paul", "Regular", email = "Paul.Regular@dfo-mpo.gc.ca",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Access versioned releases of the Stock Assessment Inputs and Outputs
    Database. Browse fish stocks and assessment runs, and read official inputs,
    assumptions, and outputs from local compressed files.
